    {
      "textRaw": "Zip",
      "name": "zip",
      "desc": "<p><code>zip</code> 模块用于创建、读取、解压和修改 ZIP 文件. 底层使用 Zip4j.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/zip/Zip.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/augment/zip/ZipNativeObject.kt</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">zip</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] zip",
          "name": "[@]_zip",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "zip(zipPath)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "zip",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>zip(zipPath)</code> 与 <a href=\"#m-open\">zip.open(zipPath)</a> 等价.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] zip"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] open",
          "name": "[m]_open",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "open(zipPath, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "open",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>zipPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - ZIP 文件路径, 不可为空</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"#zipoptions\">ZipOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipnativeobject\">ZipNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开或创建一个 ZIP 操作对象.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "zipPath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] open"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] zipFile",
          "name": "[m]_zipfile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "zipFile(filePath, destZipPath?, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "zipFile",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>filePath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ destZipPath ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 目标 ZIP 路径; 省略时使用源文件名</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"#zipoptions\">ZipOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipnativeobject\">ZipNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>将单个文件加入 ZIP.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">zip.zipFile(&#39;./logs/a.txt&#39;, &#39;./logs.zip&#39;);\n</code></pre>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "filePath"
