              "name": "zipFiles",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.7.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>filePathList</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#iterable\">Iterable</a> } - 文件路径列表</li>\n<li><strong>[ destZipPath ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"#zipoptions\">ZipOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#zipnativeobject\">ZipNativeObject</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>批量压缩文件. <code>filePathList</code> 必须可迭代, 且每个文件必须存在.</p>\n",
