        {
          "textRaw": "[m] getZipFile",
          "name": "[m]_getzipfile",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "getZipFile()",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "getZipFile",
              "desc": "<p>返回底层 Zip4j 对象.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">ZipOptions</p>\n\n<hr>\n<p>常用选项:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>password</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - ZIP 密码. 压缩时会自动启用加密.</li>\n<li><strong>aesKeyStrength</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - AES 强度, 支持 <code>128</code> / <code>192</code> / <code>256</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>aesVersion</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - AES 版本.</li>\n<li><strong>compressionLevel</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 压缩等级.</li>\n<li><strong>compressionMethod</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 压缩方式.</li>\n<li><strong>encryptionMethod</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 加密方式.</li>\n<li><strong>defaultFolderPath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>entryCRC</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>entrySize</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>excludeFileFilter</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">function</a> } - 返回 <code>true</code> 时排除文件.</li>\n<li><strong>fileComment</strong> / <strong>comment</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>fileNameInZip</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>includeRootFolder</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>overrideExistingFilesInZip</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>readHiddenFiles</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>readHiddenFolders</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>unixMode</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>writeExtendedLocalFileHeader</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>lastModifiedFileTime</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>rootFolderNameInZip</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>symbolicLinkAction</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>解压选项:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>password</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>isExtractSymbolicLinks</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注: <code>ignoreDateTimeAttributes</code> / <code>isIgnoreDateTimeAttributes</code> 在当前 Zip4j 2.x 实现中不再支持.</p>\n</blockquote>\n",
